# Undefined symbols the core objects may reference (D-54, D-65). One name per line, leading underscore stripped; NAME then TAB then Darwin limits an entry to that platform.
# The core has no allocator and no host call: the four memory builtins below are the whole list. Any other entry needs a one-line justification comment.
memcpy
memmove
memset
memcmp
bzero	Darwin
__chkstk_darwin	Darwin
